WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.058 --> 00:00:05.373
Welcome to Pharmaideia. The approved identity and compact Home bring your academic tools together.

2
00:00:05.373 --> 00:00:09.512
Courses stay empty until reviewed institutional content is supplied. No sample academic records are presented.

3
00:00:09.512 --> 00:00:13.661
Planner works now. Add a personal study task. These reminders stay in this tab and clear on reload.

4
00:00:13.661 --> 00:00:17.922
Start or pause a focus session. Leaving Planner resets the timer.

5
00:00:17.922 --> 00:00:23.100
Personal progress is separate from official academic records. Create your own non-confidential outline and topic.

6
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:28.188
Mark a topic covered and record your confidence. Coverage does not demonstrate mastery.

7
00:00:28.188 --> 00:00:32.289
Announcements support search and reading filters. There are no live notices in this development view.

8
00:00:32.289 --> 00:00:36.454
Community remains discoverable while messaging is restricted. Secure messaging must be completed before public launch.

9
00:00:36.454 --> 00:00:40.562
Find Timetable, Settings and Help through More. Appearance controls work locally without collecting account information.

10
00:00:40.562 --> 00:00:44.564
Help is searchable and includes this optional captioned video and a written transcript. Account services are not publicly activated.
